<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Coomloughra Horseshoe from the Hydro car park — Clockwise from the Hydro car park [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>The Coomloughra Horseshoe starts at the Hydro car park near Glencar in County Kerry, Ireland. Climb clockwise through Skregmore to Beenkeragh, cross the rocky ridge to Carrauntoohil and return over Caher. Mountain lakes below and changing summit views reward the complete circuit. Allow a full mountain day: the narrow ridge requires climbing over steep rock using your hands, a head for heights and competent navigation. Choose settled, clear conditions; avoid wind or ice. The privately farmed Reeks prohibit dogs.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors — OpenStreetMap route and path geometry. Licence: ODbL-1.0 (https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1.0/). Source: https://www.openstreetmap.org/.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="52.0226769" lon="-9.7902493"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0226198" lon="-9.7901343"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0225512" lon="-9.7899717"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0224185" lon="-9.7898456"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0223756" lon="-9.7897464"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0223615" lon="-9.7896365"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0224267" lon="-9.7893038"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0224853" lon="-9.7890249"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0225687" lon="-9.7888398"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0226768" lon="-9.7887432"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0228731" lon="-9.788577"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0230886" lon="-9.7883329"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0231217" lon="-9.7882433"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0231117" lon="-9.7881827"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0230209" lon="-9.7878072"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0228443" lon="-9.7872627"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0226677" lon="-9.7866833"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0221527" lon="-9.7851142"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0219019" lon="-9.7841942"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0211226" lon="-9.7817344"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0210436" lon="-9.7815496"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0208833" lon="-9.7813858"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0207842" lon="-9.7813648"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0205633" lon="-9.7813725"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0199113" lon="-9.7814664"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0190051" lon="-9.7815844"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0172545" lon="-9.7818124"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0170127" lon="-9.7817937"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0167346" lon="-9.7817346"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0162501" lon="-9.7816783"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0159603" lon="-9.7816863"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0157615" lon="-9.7817387"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0150533" lon="-9.7818232"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.014747" lon="-9.7818607"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0146274" lon="-9.7819197"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0140051" lon="-9.7822469"></trkpt><trkpt lat="52.0133328" lon="-